'''Snowman''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Christmas Box]] in the [[Christmas Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It contains of a blade with a winter-themed landscape with a snowman also on the blade, hence the name.

